div.p:
I. He gives an account of himself and prays
for himself, v. 7,
8.

24 There is that scattereth, and yet increaseth;
and there is that withholdeth more than is meet, but it
tendeth to poverty.

22 Say not thou, I will recompense evil;
but wait on the Lord, and he
shall save thee.

